Title: "Exists"
Id: "c7b6b9e3-5c6c-4607-957f-b73399641e6f"

Text: "`exists:` introduces one or more symbols and optionally constrains them with `suchThat:`.

```mlg-fragment
exists: x is \\real
```

```mlg-fragment
exists:
. x is \\real
. y is \\real
suchThat:
. x != y
```

`suchThat:` is optional. Symbols introduced by `exists:` are available in the optional `suchThat:` clauses."
Id: "b7cc8416-6413-4236-8f7a-0decdb1f60ab"
